Z||000000||Jimmy||09-16-2001||04:30 AM||||FIRST OFF:  This post is about video of me street racing at a local hang out.  I know many are against Street racing for various good reasons.  I don't want to get into a discussion about "street racing bad or good."  We can do that on another thread.<P>Guys and Gals, I just got back from a fun(successful) night of street/drag racing and got most of it on video.  Not sure if I should break the video down or just leave it one big cut(lots of good stuff other than my Fiero).  Its about 15 minutes and was filmed mostly in Sony NightShot.  <P>I also have no idea where I can find a good place on the internet to host my video. <P>If anyone can help me out or pass along some good advice it would be much appreciated.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I want to show how "easy" I go on my getrag with my V8 bolted to it.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Jim<BR>87 GT T-TOP V8<BR>87 GT  <P><p>[This message has been edited by Jimmy (edited 09-16-2001).]||||reg||1
