Z||000003||Jimmy||09-16-2001||05:42 PM||||Oh and just to let everyone know whats on the video....<P>I raced:<P>95 Mustang 5.0 full exahust headers intake<BR>Ford Fairlane 400 horse<BR>Turbo bug<BR>Camaro RS Late model<BR>Trans Am Late model<BR>Black 87-93 Mustang Heavily modded 12 second car<BR>Early 80s Camaro over 400hp in motor<BR>POS lincoln<BR>Ford lightning new <BR>70s Monte Carlo 400ci Aluminum heads<BR>80s Monte Carlo SS<P>I had a total of 12 races, shut my car down for about 15 minutes once, had no problems what so ever except the one race I lost.  That damn mustang was fast!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Jim<BR>87 GT T-TOP V8<BR>87 GT||||reg||1
